sequenceDiagram
    %% SD2 - Find products and check stock
    %% Stories: 18, 19, 20, 21, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28, 29, 41
    %% Description: A customer searches, filters and sorts products, reads product information, and checks stock, location and availability in stores.
    %% direct CP->ST: searching products and stock is not about the customer's own data
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant ST as Store
    participant PR as Product

    %% covers 18
    CP->>ST: search for a product
    ST->>PR: products
    %% covers 19, 20, 21
    CP->>ST: filter and sort the results
    %% covers 23, 24
    CP->>PR: scan a product for its information
    %% covers 25, 28
    CP->>ST: check stock and quantity
    %% covers 41
    CP->>ST: find product location in the store
    opt product is sold out
        %% covers 27, 29
        CP->>ST: see restock date and other stores
        %% covers 26
        CP->>PR: ask to be notified when back in stock
    end
